(complete() after); unprepared copies hung the phone in SweetMesa's bridge (fingerprint-freeze-bisect-2026-11-18.md).

diff --git a/iokit/Kernel/arm/SweetABP.cpp b/iokit/Kernel/arm/SweetABP.cpp
